# Build-context filter for the workspace images (unbien-durable/Dockerfile.durable
# and any image built from the repo root). The host's node_modules (workspace
# symlinks + platform-native binaries), build output, and non-workspace trees
# must not ride along — the image installs its own dependencies for its own
# platform, and a host dist/ would shadow the in-image build.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.gitignore
app
relay
docs
scripts
.quarto.yml
*.md
!README.md
.DS_Store